  "description": "Three low beams make up this set, each a rounded rail on short legs, in teal, yellow and red. Laid out at different angles, they give children a path to walk heel to toe, step from one beam to the next and hold their arms out for balance. Because the beams sit close to the ground, younger children can try them alongside older ones, and teachers can use them for simple balance drills during games periods. The product area is 2'9\" x 12'11\", and the safe play area is 7'9\" x 17'11\". It is listed as Multi Color. Our 3-year warranty applies to the galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts and composite laminates. Ask us to fit the Balancing Beam into your layout.",
