    "pText": "Each beam stands on short legs that are grouted or installed self-standing. Set the three beams on level ground with rubber flooring or another soft surface around them, inside the 7'9\" x 17'11\" zone. Check the leg fixings during routine maintenance and keep the beam tops clean, as mud or algae after rain makes them slippery.",
